","speakerId":5062,"speakerName":"ヴェルー","textMapHash":1343956378,"text":"今度は僕が鬼だよ！絶対にロウを捕まえてみせるもん！","nextNodeIds":[240060102]},{"nodeId":240060102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5021,"speakerName":"ロウ","textMapHash":1341829178,"text":"それはどうかしら？登れない場所だってあるでしょ。","nextNodeIds":[240060103]},{"nodeId":240060103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5062,"speakerName":"ヴェルー","textMapHash":490271514,"text":"う…それは靴が合ってないからだもん！靴をかえたら絶対に捕まえられるもん！","nextNodeIds":[240060104]},{"nodeId":240060104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5021,"speakerName":"ロウ","textMapHash":1191916426,"text":"だったら二人とも靴を脱ぎましょうよ。これで公平でしょ！","nextNodeIds":[240060105]},{"nodeId":240060105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5063,"speakerName":"オーレル","textMapHash":2296549130,"text":"こらこら！ここら辺は廃棄パーツだらけなんだぜ。裸足で走り回って怪我でもしたらどうするんだよ？","nextNodeIds":[240060106]},{"nodeId":240060106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5021,"speakerName":"ロウ","textMapHash":2834105698,"text":"はぁい…","nextNodeIds":[240060107]},{"nodeId":240060107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5062,"speakerName":"ヴェルー","textMapHash":659337946,"text":"わかったよ…","nextNodeIds":[240060108]},{"nodeId":240060108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5062,"speakerName":"ヴェルー","textMapHash":1686651362,"text":"ねぇ…おにいちゃん、さっき僕を捕まえたとき、なんでぼんやりしてたの？目の前を走っていったのに、なんだかぼうっとしてるんだもん。","nextNodeIds":[240060109]},{"nodeId":240060109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5063,"speakerName":"オーレル","textMapHash":749839194,"text":"え、そうだったか？完全に無意識だったよ…","nextNodeIds":[240060110]},{"nodeId":240060110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5021,"speakerName":"ロウ","textMapHash":3254305618,"text":"そうよ。あたしなんて周りをぐるぐる回ってたのに、完全に上の空だったわよ。","nextNodeIds":[240060111]},{"nodeId":240060111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5063,"speakerName":"オーレル","textMapHash":3176672074,"text":"#でも…あれ？{M#お兄さん}{F#お姉さん}、どうしましたか？","nextNodeIds":[240060112,240060115]},{"nodeId":240060112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2240558090,"text":"ロウはどうしてここに？","nextNodeIds":[240060113]},{"nodeId":240060113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5021,"speakerName":"ロウ","textMapHash":1864365666,"text":"パパは出張続きで、ママもお仕事なの。","nextNodeIds":[240060114]},{"nodeId":240060114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5021,"speakerName":"ロウ","textMapHash":11655730,"text":"そしたらちょうどオーレルが本を返しにきて、パパがオーレルに私たちの世話をお願いしたの。だから一緒に遊んでるのよ。","nextNodeIds":[240060118]},{"nodeId":240060118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5063,"speakerName":"オーレル","textMapHash":399131010,"text":"まぁいいか。それじゃ、次は誰が鬼をやる？","nextNodeIds":[240060119,240060120]},{"nodeId":240060119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2046962114,"text":"あまりかくれんぼは好きじゃないんじゃ？","nextNodeIds":[240060121]},{"nodeId":240060121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5063,"speakerName":"オーレル","textMapHash":3626846610,"text":"それは、コホン…実は最近初めての評論を書いてて、色々と考えることがあるんです。","nextNodeIds":[240060122]},{"nodeId":240060122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5063,"speakerName":"オーレル","textMapHash":3775467298,"text":"それで、その…体を動かしてると頭の回転が速くなるなって思ったので…","nextNodeIds":[240060123]},{"nodeId":240060123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5021,"speakerName":"ロウ","textMapHash":474604466,"text":"でもすぐにぼうっとするわよね。ひどい時なんかその場でぶつぶつ独り言を言い出して、全然こっちに気づかないんだから。","nextNodeIds":[240060124]},{"nodeId":240060124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5062,"speakerName":"ヴェルー","textMapHash":2785040434,"text":"#{M#おにいちゃん}{F#おねえちゃん}も一緒に遊ぼうよ。かくれんぼが一番得意だもんね。","nextNodeIds":[240060125,240060126]},{"nodeId":240060125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":66651178,"text":"いいよ。","nextNodeIds":[240060127]},{"nodeId":240060127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5062,"speakerName":"ヴェルー","textMapHash":1968858882,"text":"えへへ、どうかなあ？僕とロウは「かくれんぼマスター」だもんね！","nextNodeIds":[240060128]},{"nodeId":240060128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5062,"speakerName":"ヴェルー","textMapHash":3117639002,"text":"よーし、じゃあ今からね！ロウ、早く隠れようよ！","nextNodeIds":[240060129]},{"nodeId":240060129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":2946633346,"text":"ロウとヴェルーはあっという間に走り去っていった。一方、オーレルは何か考え込む様子でゆっくりと離れていった…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":240060126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1701721458,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}には勝てっこないと思うよ。","nextNodeIds":[240060127]},{"nodeId":240060120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1117378322,"text":"どうして急にかくれんぼがしたくなったの？","nextNodeIds":[240060121]},{"nodeId":240060115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1552988778,"text":"またかくれんぼ？","nextNodeIds":[240060116]},{"nodeId":240060116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5063,"speakerName":"オーレル","textMapHash":2456399202,"text":"そうです。ドルリューおじさんは出張があるしデュメおばさんも仕事だから、ロウの世話を頼まれて。","nextNodeIds":[240060117]},{"nodeId":240060117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5063,"speakerName":"オーレル","textMapHash":221739466,"text":"それで、ロウをここに連れてきて一緒に遊んでるんです…スカートを汚さないといいけど…","nextNodeIds":[240060118]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2400601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["5062"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2400602,"order":2,"stepDescription":"子供たちを見つける","stepDescTextMapHash":803907228,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2400602,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":